#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukucima zonke iziphumo ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP kwisixokelelwano?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukucima iziphumo ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP eziphelelwe lixesha ngoku?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukucoca imisebenzi yokuskena ye-Mactrack egcinwe kwi-cache?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukucima zonke iziphumo ze-Port edityanisiweyo ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP kwisixokelelwano?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukucima uze udale kwakhona zonke iziphumo ze-Port edityanisiweyo ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP kwisixokelelwano?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukukhuphela uze ungenise isiseko sedatha se-IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI ngoku?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuba ufuna ukwakha kwakhona uluhlu lwemihla yokuskena ukusuka kwiziphumo ezigciniweyo ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP ngoku?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Yakha kwakhona uze uhlalutye icandelo eliqulathe uqwalaselo lwamva nje lwe-port, ekuyiveki yangoku ngezahlulelo zeveki. Itafile engenazahlulelo iphuculwa ngokupheleleyo. Ukuskena okucwangcisiweyo kuyatsitywa ngelixa oku kuqhuba. Qhubeka?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Qhuba olu gcino lwenkqubo ngaphandle kweeyure zomsebenzi. Ukwakhiwa ngokutsha kukopa imbali epheleleyo yeeteyibhile zezibuko (idilesi ye-MAC), idilesi ye-IP kunye ne-802.1x ngokulandelelana kwaye kunokuthatha iiyure. Uhlolo olucwangcisiweyo luyatsitywa, ugcino lwedathabheyisi luyalinda, kwaye ukukhangela i-MAC, i-IP ne-802.1x kubonisa umyalezo wogcino lwenkqubo de kugqitywe. Vumela isithuba sediski esikhululekileyo sekopi yesibini yeteyibhile nganye kunye nezalathisi zayo. Qhubeka?"

