#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Icima izidibanisi ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP eziphelelwe lixesha kwisiseko sedatha. Kuphela ziirekhodi eziphelelwe lixesha, ngokusekelwe kwimimiselo yakho, ezisuswayo."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Hlaziya iDathabheyisi ye-IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Lo msebenzi uza kukhuphela kwaye ufake idathabheyisi yamva nje ye-OIU kwiWebhusayithi ye-IEEE. IKhadi leNxibelelwano lweNethiwekhi (NIC) ngalinye lineDilesi ye-MAC. IDilesi ye-MAC inokwahlulwa ibe ngamacandelo amabini. Icandelo lokuqala leDilesi ye-MAC liqulethe i-MAC yoMthengisi. I-MAC yoMthengisi ichaza ukuba ngubani owenze elo candelo. Oku kuya kuba luncedo ekuhloleni ngokukhawuleza izixhobo ezingafanelekanga kwinethiwekhi yakho."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Icima imisebenzi emidala nekunokwenzeka ukuba iphelelwe lixesha yokuskena ye-Mactrack kuluhlu olwehlayo olufumanayo xa uhlela uhlobo lwesixhobo."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Icima <strong>ZONKE</strong> izidibanisi ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP kwisiseko sedatha zonke iiDilesi ze-IP, uluhlu lwe-IP, kunye nee-VLAN. Esi sixhobo silungile xa ufuna ukuqala kwakhona. <strong>INGOZI: Yonke idatha yangaphambili iyacinywa.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Iyakha kwakhona uluhlu lwemihla yokuskena ukusuka kwiziphumo ezigciniweyo ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP, ifunda icandelo ngalinye kube kanye. Ukuskena nolondolozo zigcina uluhlu luhlaziyiwe, ngoko ke oku kufuneka kuphela emva kokuba iziphumo zisusiwe ngaphandle kolondolozo, umzekelo ngokucima izixhobo."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Jonga uBume beSahlulelo"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Ibonisa indlela iziphumo ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP ezahlulwe ngayo, ubungakanani besahlulo esisetyenziswayo kunye nesizathu, kunye nento eyenziwe lulondolozo lwesiseko sedatha lokugqibela."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Iyakha kwakhona kwaye ihlalutya kuphela icandelo eliqulathe uqwalaselo lwamva nje lwe-port ukuze ibuyisele isithuba esicinyiweyo; ngezahlulelo zeveki oko yiveki yangoku. Iitafile ezingenazahlulelo ziphuculwa ngokupheleleyo. Ukuskena okucwangcisiweyo kuyatsitywa de kugqitywe."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Khetha izahlulelo zemihla ngemihla okanye zeveki, okanye ucime ukwahlula, kwiitheyibhile zezibuko (idilesi ye-MAC), idilesi ye-IP kunye ne-802.1x. Ukwakha ngokutsha kukopa yonke imbali ngasemva; iiskeni ezicwangcisiweyo ziyatsitywa kwaye ukukhangela kwe-MAC, IP ne-802.1x kubonisa umyalezo wolondolozo ngelo xesha."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Ulawulo lweTheyibhile eDityanisiweyo"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Icima ZONKE izidibanisi ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP <strong>Ezidibeneyo</strong> (Hayi iZiphumo zoSkeno) kwisiseko sedatha. Idatha iya kuqokelelwa kwakhona ngokusekelwe <strong>kuphela kwidatha entsha</strong> eskeniweyo kusebenza okulandelayo kwe-Poller ye-mactrack."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr "Icima ZONKE izidibanisi ze-Port ukuya kwi-MAC ukuya kwi-IP <strong>Ezidibeneyo</strong> (Hayi iZiphumo zoSkeno) kwisiseko sedatha kwaye izidale kwakhona ngokusekelwe <strong>Kuyo yonke idatha eskeniweyo</strong> ngoku."

