#: setup.php
msgid "MAC Address Scanning Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuSkena iDilesi ye-MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Mactrack scanning function to call in order to obtain and store port details.  The function name is all that is required.  The following four parameters are assumed and will always be appended: 'my_function($site, &$device, $lowport, $highport)'.  There is no function required for a pure router."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuskena we-Mactrack ekufuneka ubizwe ukuze ufumane kwaye ugcine iinkcukacha ze-port. Igama lomsebenzi kuphela elifunekayo. Ezi pharamitha zine zilandelayo ziyathathwa njengezikhoyo kwaye ziya kuhlala zifakelwa ekugqibeleni: 'my_function($site, &$device, $lowport, $highport)'. Akukho msebenzi ufunekayo kwi-router eyiyo."

#: setup.php
msgid "IP Address Scanning Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi woKuskena iDilesi ye-IP"

#: setup.php
msgid "Mactrack scanning function specific to Layer3 devices that track IP Addresses."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuskena we-Mactrack obhekiselele ngokukodwa kwizixhobo ze-Layer3 ezilandela iiDilesi ze-IP."

#: setup.php
msgid "802.1x Scanning Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuSkena we-802.1x"

#: setup.php
msgid "Mactrack scanning function specific to Switches with dot1x enabled."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuskena we-Mactrack obhekiselele ngokukodwa kwii-Switch ezivuliweyo i-dot1x."

#: setup.php
msgid "Serial Number Base OID"
msgstr "I-OID eSiseko yeNombolo yoMlandelelwano"

#: setup.php
msgid "The SNMP OID used to obtain this device types serial number to be stored in the Mactrack Asset Information table."
msgstr "I-SNMP OID esetyenziselwa ukufumana inombolo yesiriyali yolu hlobo lwesixhobo ukuze igcinwe kwitheyibhile yoLwazi lwe-Asethi ye-Mactrack."

#: setup.php
msgid "Serial Number Collection Method"
msgstr "Indlela yokuQokelela iNombolo yoMlandelelwano"

#: setup.php
msgid "How is the serial number collected for this OID.  If 'SNMP Walk', we assume multiple serial numbers.  If 'Get', it will be only one.."
msgstr "Iqokelelwa njani inombolo ye-serial yale OID.  Ukuba ngu-'SNMP Walk', sicinga ukuba kukho iinombolo ze-serial ezininzi.  Ukuba ngu-'Get', iya kuba nye kuphela.."

