#: setup.php
msgid "Provide a list of ports on a specific switch/hub whose MAC results should be ignored.  Ports such as link/trunk ports that can not be distinguished from other user ports are examples.  Each port number must be separated by a colon, pipe, or a space ':', '|', ' '.  For example, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' or 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' would be acceptable for some manufacturers switch types."
msgstr "Nika uludwe lwee-port kwiswitshi/hub ethile eziziphumo zayo ze-MAC ezifanele ukungahoywa. Ii-port ezifana nee-port ze-link/trunk ezingenakwahlulwa kwezinye ii-port zomsebenzisi yimizekelo. Inombolo ye-port nganye mayahlulwe ngekholoni, umbhobho, okanye isithuba ':', '|', ' '. Umzekelo, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' okanye 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' ingamkeleka kwezinye iintlobo zeeswitshi zabavelisi."

